sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant H as Hashi
  participant B as Your Bitcoin Cash wallet
  participant C as Cauldron
  participant T as THORChain
  participant E as Your Ethereum wallet
  You->>H: 20 PUSD → USDC on Ethereum
  H-->>You: Cauldron → THORChain: 19.5791 USDC, $0.37 in fees, ~10 min
  You->>H: Start swap
  H->>C: build the PUSD sale (held to your slippage), proceeds to your own address
  H->>B: approval 1: sign the sale
  B-->>C: PUSD sold for BCH (broadcast through Electrum, then saved)
  H->>T: real quote for that BCH: the vault address and memo
  H->>B: approval 2: send the BCH to THORChain's vault, with the memo
  B->>T: BCH
  Note over T: starts once the deposit confirms
  loop every 5 s until it settles
    H->>T: status?
  end
  T->>E: USDC on Ethereum
